    "scope": "Complete actual centered selfadjoint stationary reflected mean, canonical mean-zero restriction, positive full/centered squared defects; real consumer derives sharp centered coercivity and IsUnit on the same complete domain.",
    "body_reasons": [
      {
        "step": "Actual law and uniform witnesses",
        "evidence": "Production calls actual55 with unchanged C2/global Hessian/positive alpha/capped positive eta binders, obtaining probability mu/J/nu, genuine Markov S, every-y literal tilted law, Lambda disintegration/both marginals, reflection U, actual snd isometry M and uniform T before arbitrary rough u. No law, normalization, centering or operator certificate is a public premise."
      },
      {
        "step": "Selfadjoint scalar compression",
        "evidence": "P is the actual lpMeas/condExpL2 projection. inner_condExpL2_left_eq_right proves its symmetry. The proof uses PM=M and MT=PUPM together with M.inner_map_map and the actual U symmetry to derive T symmetry/selfadjointness. It needs no M surjectivity onto the joint Hilbert space."
      },
      {
        "step": "Stationarity and hidden integrability",
        "evidence": "Lambda.IsCondKernel S plus Lambda.fst=nu yields nu compProd S=Lambda. u in L2(nu) and actual probability give L1; pulling along Lambda.snd=nu makes (x,y)↦u(y) integrable. The actual AE T representative, integral_compProd, integral_map and Lambda.snd then prove integral(Tu)=integral(u). All selected rough representatives are used AE only."
      },
      {
        "step": "Canonical constant fixed",
        "evidence": "q is L2Expectation.one nu=Lp.const 2 nu 1; actual probability supplies finite measure. inner_one_eq_integral gives the actual integral pairing, and coeFn_const gives q AE1. Tq=q is proved via selfadjointness, stationarity and ext_inner_right, without wrongly assuming the q representative integrates1 in every conditional fiber."
      },
      {
        "step": "Exact centered closed domain",
        "evidence": "H0 is exactly the kernel of the continuous functional innerSL real q; hPair proves membership iff integral zero. Kernel completeness follows from pinned completeSpace_ker and complete L2. Mean preservation proves invariance. T0 is (T.comp H0.subtypeL).codRestrict H0 hInv, so its ambient action is literally T, not an independently supplied projected operator."
      },
      {
        "step": "Squared defects",
        "evidence": "Selfadjoint T/T0 gives inner((I-T²)u,u)=norm(u)²-norm(Tu)² and the same on H0. Norm contractions and IsSelfAdjoint.one/sub/pow prove positive endomorphisms via isPositive_iff prime. Full defect kills q from Tq=q. The centered defect ambient action agrees definitionally with the full defect. No Gamma square root or B operator identity is substituted for these claims."
      },
      {
        "step": "Actual consumer and SAME operator",
        "evidence": "The Test calls the real producer and explicitly instantiates existing58. It identifies U58=U by each map’s AE reflection action and Lp.ext. For u in the exact H0, PM=M supplies actual macro range; hM AE snd pullback and nu=J.snd transport the actual integral to establish centeredness. M.norm_map and MT=PUPM transfer the sharp58 macro norm bound to this exact T0. No generic range certificate or fresh PI copy is used."
      },
